<section class="stage-section" data-stage="philosophy" data-title="Philosophy">
  <p class="label">Philosophy</p>
  <h2>How I think.</h2>
  <div class="philosophy-list">
    <p class="philosophy-line" data-typed data-typed-text="Stylishness isn't something you look at. It's how I say exactly what I feel."></p>
    <p class="philosophy-line" data-typed data-typed-text="A limit is not a stop. It's a challenge."></p>
    <p class="philosophy-proof" data-reveal>
      RunBox exists because a 4GB MacBook Air on macOS 11 couldn't run Docker. So
      instead of waiting for better hardware, I built around the limit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
